        "ASCII 0 and capital O are tall ovals here (aspect ≈ 0.64) so they are out. "
        "Also out: enclosed ①Ⓐ, ⊕⊗, pies. ⚫ is 2-cell in this stack but is a geometric circle so it is in. "
